 France. The university's namesake is French", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.767, "bm25": 8.2, "dense_rank": 2, "bm25_rank": 11, "rrf": 0.03021, "selected": false}, {"text": "and \"Gustave Eiffel has gone mad: he has been confined in an Asylum\" appeared in the popular press. At this stage a small \"creeper\" crane was installed in each ", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.678, "bm25": 8.44, "dense_rank": 11, "bm25_rank": 9, "rrf": 0.02858, "selected": false}, {"text": "He is best known for the Eiffel Tower, designed by his company and built for the 1889 Universal Exposition in Paris, and his contribution to building the Statue", "source": "web", "dense": 0.693, "bm25": 7.86, "dense_rank": 9, "bm25_rank": 16, "rrf": 0.02765, "selected": false}], "selected": 3, "echo_filtered": 0, "kept": 3}, "t": 11.211}
