el Constructions m\u00e9talliques) is part of the Eif", "source": "web", "dense": 0.709, "bm25": 7.97, "dense_rank": 5, "bm25_rank": 16, "rrf": 0.02854, "selected": false}, {"text": "Eiffel initially showed little enthusiasm, but he did approve further study, and the two engineers then asked Stephen Sauvestre, the head of the company's archi", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.654, "bm25": 8.45, "dense_rank": 16, "bm25_rank": 9, "rrf": 0.02765, "selected": false}, {"text": "On 12 May, a commission was set up to examine Eiffel's scheme and its rivals and on 12 June it presented its decision, which was that only Eiffel's proposal met", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.658, "bm25": 8.24, "dense_rank": 14, "bm25_rank": 13, "rrf": 0.02721, "selected": false}], "selected": 3, "echo_filtered": 0, "kept": 3}, "t": 11.35}
